		"meta": {
			"author": "Stefan Mazur",
			"category": "effect",
			"deploymentTarget": {
				"branch": "",
				"name": "Wire",
				"version": {
					"major": 7,
					"minor": 29,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Motion Bridge - Fireflies: fireflies fly about, over the screen or over the floor in perspective, blink on and off, swarm around whatever stands still and flee from motion; fleeing always wins. Reverse (0 to 1) swaps the roles: they swarm around motion and flee from what stands still (animate it in Arena, e.g. Timeline 30 s, Loop, to swap every 15 s). Driven by the Motion Bridge field (Spout); calm without the bridge; transparent background. Needs the Motion Bridge tool. In Arena, load the Spout source 'Motion Bridge' as a clip at its own size, set the layer's Auto Size to Stretch, put this patch on the clip (after its Transform) and set the layer's blend mode to Alpha. Runs in real time. Scale sizes everything relative to the output height (surface model, scene coordinates of the example Scaler). Show Field shows what is evaluated: light grey where a sensor sees (red occupancy, green motion), hatched where nothing reaches the fireflies (outside the field or the area, in a shadow); white the base line, magenta the other edges. Fireflies: Firefly Plane (Screen = flat over the frame, Floor = hovering over the floor in perspective, smaller with the distance), Firefly Density (per output height squared, grows with the surface), Performance Cap (at most this many, up to 1024), Firefly Size, Glow Size, Firefly Color, Glow Color, Firefly Twinkle (flicker while lit), Firefly Life (seconds lit), Dark Time (seconds dark). Physics: Wander, Air Drag, Swarm Strength, Flee Strength, Reverse. Halo: Halo On shows what stands still as a soft light that follows the blurred field; Halo Color, Halo Opacity. View: Horizon Y (for a field on the floor). Field: where the bridge's field lies in the picture, as in Motion Bridge - Fabric Wind: Field Plane (Floor or Screen), Field X, Field Y, Field Width, Field Height (true proportions: Field Height = Field Width x field depth / field width x frame width / frame height), Field Size (scales the field as set), Field Rotation (0 = base line at the bottom), Shadow Hold (seconds a spot the sensors cannot see keeps its state). Shader: Resource\/Fireflies.fs.",
			"displayName": "Motion Bridge - Fireflies",
			"identifier": "94070c53-702b-4049-b9bc-eb4f4775bbf0",
			"licenseName": "Unlicense",
			"mail": "S.Mazur@cati-co.de",
			"note": {
				"text": "",
				"textColorIndex": 1,
				"textSizeMultiplier": 3
			},
